# Runtime Dev Notes 18 — Final Cleanup / Runtime Entrypoint Rename

Branch/work item: `runtime-lifecycle-modularization-v1-final-cleanup`

## Purpose

This branch performs the narrow final cleanup pass after the lifecycle modularization sequence through `workerProtocolRouter.mjs`.

The branch intentionally preserves runtime behavior while making the current parent runtime entrypoint name accurate after the modularization work.

## Source base

Source base used for this branch:

```text
runtime-dev-repo-modularization.zip
```

That source already included the completed modularization sequence through:

```text
workerProtocolRouter.mjs / docs/dev-notes.17
```

## Files added

```text
runtime.mjs
docs/dev-notes.18
```

## Files removed

```text
inference.mjs
```

## Files modified

```text
runtimeRequestSettlement.mjs
active smoke tests that import/copy the public runtime entrypoint
legacy smoke tests that import/copy the public runtime entrypoint
```

## Entrypoint rename

`inference.mjs` was renamed to:

```text
runtime.mjs
```

Reason:

```text
The file is no longer just an inference implementation file. After the lifecycle modularization branches, it is the public Runtime Dev composition root and API entrypoint.
```

No compatibility shim was kept. Executable tests and fixture-copy lists were updated to import/copy `runtime.mjs` directly.

Historical references to `inference.mjs` in earlier `docs/dev-notes.01` through `docs/dev-notes.17` remain historical records of the branch sequence at the time those notes were written. This note records the rename so the transition is explicit rather than lost.

## Request-settlement cleanup

The parent-side cancellation-notification helpers were moved from the entrypoint file into:

```text
runtimeRequestSettlement.mjs
```

Moved helpers:

```text
notifyRequestCancellationRequested(req, reason)
notifyRequestsCancellationRequested(requests, reason)
```

This keeps request settlement / cancellation notification primitives together with:

```text
resolvePromptResult(req, msg)
closeRequestCancelChannel(req)
settleCompletedRequest(req, msg, deps)
settleFailedRequest(req, err, deps)
```

Behavior intended to remain unchanged:

```text
only running requests receive parent cancel-port notifications
notification payload shape remains unchanged
notification failures remain swallowed because the port may already be closed
cancellation loops in reset/session/shutdown coordinators remain coordinator-owned
cancelPrompt remains a fast parent-side path
```

## Redundant alias cleanup

The redundant local `assertNoSessionResetInProgress()` pass-through alias was removed from the entrypoint file.

The coordinator dependency injection now passes:

```js
assertNoSessionResetInProgress: assertNoActiveSessionResetInProgress
```

This keeps coordinator-facing dependency names unchanged while removing one unnecessary local wrapper.

## Folder layout decision

No physical folder restructuring was done in this branch.

Reason:

```text
Moving files into folders affects worker-relative imports, worker/model path assumptions, fixture-copy smoke tests, and many root-relative test imports. That should be handled in a dedicated layout branch if desired.
```

## Explicit non-goals

This branch does not change:

```text
worker protocol messages
workerBridge ownership or generation guard behavior
scheduler behavior
request settlement ordering
stream shaping
init/reset/session/shutdown coordinator semantics
configOverride surface
model path or model identity behavior
prompt/output semantics
worker-local/native execution behavior
folder structure
```

## Verification plan

Minimum verification for this branch:

```bash
find . -name '*.mjs' -print0 | sort -z | xargs -0 -n1 node --check
grep -R "inference\.mjs" -n --include='*.mjs' .
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestNativeOperationHardStopPolicy.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerOperationSerialization.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestInitThenResetWithoutPriorPrompt.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestContextCreationRetry.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestContextCreationCancelBoundary.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerNativeCancellationBoundary.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestDrainShutdown.mjs
SKIP_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestHardwareAwareInitRetry.mjs
```

Expected grep result:

```text
No executable `.mjs` references to `inference.mjs`.
```

## Real-runtime recommendation

Because this branch renames the public runtime entrypoint and touches active test imports, Michael-side real-runtime checks are recommended before merge readiness even though the code changes are intended to be behavior-preserving.

Suggested checks:

```bash
node ./tests/smokeTestLifecycleRegression.mjs
SMOKE_MODE=real-orchestrator node ./tests/smokeTestInitThenResetWithoutPriorPrompt.mjs
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestNativeOperationHardStopPolicy.mjs
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestDrainShutdown.mjs
node ./tests/smokeTestHardwareAwareInitRetry.mjs
```

## Future work not included

Possible future branch:

